        <h3>Step-by-Step Instructions</h3>
        <ol style="line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 1.5rem;">
            <li><strong>Open <code>2_university.py</code></strong> from the folder you downloaded in Scenario 1. (If you don't have it, download the zip below).</li>
            <li>Observe how the <code>Course</code> class takes a <code>Teacher</code> object in its <code>__init__</code>. This is <strong>Dependency Injection</strong>.</li>
            <li>Complete the <code>enroll_student(self, student)</code> method. It should append the student object to <code>self.students</code>.</li>
            <li>Complete `roll_call()`. Loop through `self.students` and call `introduce()` on each one.</li>
            <li><strong>Main Block:</strong> Create one Teacher ("Mr. Smith"), one Course ("CS101"), and three Students. Link them together and verify the roll call works.</li>
